      "releaseNotes": "What’s New in Version 2.6\n\nAdded more instrument images to expand visual study and recognition\nImproved image support across the library, flashcards, and quiz modes\nCleaned up duplicate entries for a more consistent study experience\nFixed quiz data issues and improved content alignment across the app\nRefined screen presentation with small visual polish updates\nGeneral fixes and improvements",
