      "description": "Surgical Instrumentation helps you learn surgical instruments by sight, function, category, and specialty through a clean, modern study experience built around instrument recognition and reference.\n\nWith 385 instruments included, the app gives you a large visual study library for building familiarity with instrument names, profiles, and usage across specialties.\n\nThis app is designed for learners and professionals who want to strengthen instrument knowledge in a practical, visual way — including those in sterile processing, Certified Registered Central Service Technician (CRCST) study, and Certified Surgical Technologist (CST) learning.\n\nRather than focusing only on test-style review, Surgical Instrumentation centers on what matters most: recognizing instruments, understanding how they are grouped, and building confidence with real instrument images, flashcards, reference topics, and guided quiz modes.\n\nInside the app, you can:\n\n• Browse a library of 385 surgical instruments\n• Study instruments by image, type, category, and specialty\n• Open detailed instrument pages with descriptions and learning context\n• Use flashcards to study one instrument at a time\n• Build visual recognition with Image Quiz\n• Practice at your own pace with untimed review mode\n• Reinforce knowledge with Multiple Choice and True / False\n• Read helpful reference articles and instrument study topics\n• Review selected sterile processing and surgical tech support information that connects back to instrument learning\n\nBuilt for visual learning\n\nThe app is designed to help you move beyond memorizing names alone. Study the instrument image, notice defining features, compare shapes and working ends, and strengthen recall through repeated visual exposure.\n\nGreat for:\n\n• Surgical instrument study\n• CRCST-related instrument review\n• CST-related instrument familiarity\n• Sterile processing support learning\n• Visual recognition practice\n• Quick reference and study refreshers\n\nWhether you are learning instrument basics, sharpening recognition skills, or reviewing categories and reference content, Surgical Instrumentation gives you a focused way to study instruments in one place.",
